{"title":"2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a concave quadrilateral with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/437e65d3735fb1dadf06a8dc9c3d588e451252d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/0/830de927bd8077aa97abc0e3829961d12711fe7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65f4b4507bf7da7632a03a6d62c19598104054b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = CD = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"128\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f965f3742b873500fc1e353c851c012e2837d603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC=90^\\circ$\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />. Find the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:Sprint16.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/8/8e/Sprint16.jpg/350px-Sprint16.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"350\" height=\"283\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/8/8e/Sprint16.jpg/525px-Sprint16.jpg 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/8/8e/Sprint16.jpg/700px-Sprint16.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/4/3f4d2c87a203657ad3aa7743501a10348cbc8ac9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ABCD] = [ADC] - [ABC]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"223\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/a/f4afbece234689afeaed6bb54253319bfe5556f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = \\sqrt{12^2 + 16^2} = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"185\" height=\"21\" /> by the Pythagorean Thereom. We then have that the area of triangle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840cb55c82434b9ae047760636a017e9441e6ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/1/30127a2c161d33e89b5cf8ba86b0c1ad98f3f014.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20 \\cdot \\sqrt{26^2 - 10^2}}{2} = 240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"43\" />, and the area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/a/d6a0af36438b52499eab7299d2286f675eb53724.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12 \\cdot 16}{2} = 96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />, so the area of quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e27416590667f1f1ade81e89f5cb321aa2c709e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$240 - 96 = 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p>~Mathdreams\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/0/3b060e91d5fa66529dfd9ec8d3e6ddb25001bc79.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[ACD] = \\frac{24 \\cdot 20}{2}=240\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/2/172917d20b7d1c361f19f7b76afc57b581e6f6fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[ABC] = \\frac{12 \\cdot 16}{2}=96\\]\" width=\"170\" height=\"37\" />\t\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/5/5e52f3e67ab4f752c0c7bac558dbe6350a0ae554.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ABCD] = 240-96=144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"214\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>- kante314 -\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems\">Other 2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Sprint Answer Key\">2021 JMPSC Sprint Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JMPSC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"JMPSC Problems and Solutions\">All JMPSC Problems and Solutions</a></li></ol>\n<p>The problems on this page are copyrighted by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://jmpsc.org\">Junior Mathematicians' Problem Solving Competition</a>. <span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:JMPSC.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/120px-JMPSC.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/180px-JMPSC.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/a/ab/JMPSC.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018020058\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time 